  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"blob:https://imgur.com/3063a971-4efa-4852-8b64-0bc41e6b2897\" alt=\"\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jJoDs5r.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"509\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Ресурспак, который переносит криперов из мода Creeper Overhaul в ванильный Minecraft!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-Требует установки модов <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> или Optifine-</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ПРЕДУПРЕЖДЕНИЕ: ДЛЯ ЛЮБЫХ ВЕРСИЙ [1.2] И ВЫШЕ Я РЕКОМЕНДУЮ ИСПОЛЬЗОВАТЬ МОДЫ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> И <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> ВМЕСТО OPTIFINE!!!</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Чтобы использовать пак с Fresh Animations, нажмите здесь:</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KGzi90W.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"229\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Чтобы перейти на страницу модов, нажмите здесь:</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eIbsQSe.png\" width=\"530\" height=\"151\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - Художник<br>GogoMines - Создание ресурспака<br>JuceDoesThings - Совместимость с Fabric для версии 1.18</p>\n<p><strong><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-mob-models\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Mob Models </strong></span></a> - Ресурспак, полностью переделывающий модели и текстуры ванильных мобов в художественном стиле Joosh.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\"></strong></p>",
